  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e20ce9f6737e6e845b50655fcc50fb57, type: 3}
  m_Name: SpiritOfTorvalds
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Spirit of Torvalds
  lines:
  - So... you have reached the end of the path.
  - I am the life force of Linus Torvalds.
  - I have watched you, my great great great great grandson.
  - 'You are my last descendant, but more importantly, you understand what I stood
    for:'
  - Knowledge belongs to everyone.
  - You have proven yourself. There is no need to fight me.
  - Coldemort has grown too strong. It is impossible to defeat him with your current
    knowledge.
  - Here, young boy. You have earned it.
  - The most powerful spell I ever created.
  - With it, you may tear down the closed world Voldemort has built.
  - Use it wisely.
  - 'Now go..

'
  - ......Open the source.
